    "Any other key is refused. Forget it only if you reinstalled the server or changed its key on purpose." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jeder andere Schlüssel wird abgelehnt. Vergiss ihn nur, wenn du den Server neu installiert oder seinen Schlüssel absichtlich geändert hast."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any other key is refused. Forget it only if you reinstalled the server or changed its key on purpose."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cualquier otra clave se rechaza. Olvídala solo si reinstalaste el servidor o cambiaste su clave a propósito."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toute autre clé est refusée. Ne l’oubliez que si vous avez réinstallé le serveur ou changé sa clé volontairement."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Qualsiasi altra chiave viene rifiutata. Dimenticala solo se hai reinstallato il server o cambiato la sua chiave di proposito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API access tokens have full admin rights on your tailnet. Create an OAuth client with the devices:core:read scope instead, and enter client-id:client-secret." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "API-Zugriffstokens haben volle Administratorrechte für dein Tailnet. Erstelle stattdessen einen OAuth-Client mit dem Scope devices:core:read und gib client-id:client-secret ein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "API access tokens have full admin rights on your tailnet. Create an OAuth client with the devices:core:read scope instead, and enter client-id:client-secret."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Los tokens de acceso API tienen todos los derechos de administración de tu tailnet. Crea en su lugar un cliente OAuth con el scope devices:core:read e introduce client-id:client-secret."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les jetons d’accès API ont tous les droits d’administration sur votre tailnet. Créez plutôt un client OAuth avec le scope devices:core:read, et saisissez client-id:client-secret."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "I token di accesso API hanno pieni diritti di amministrazione sulla tua tailnet. Crea invece un client OAuth con lo scope devices:core:read e inserisci client-id:client-secret."
          }
        }
      }
    },
