    "On the CrowdSec host, run cscli bouncers add PatchNode and paste the key. Use the Local API URL behind your HTTPS reverse proxy. Only local detections and manual bans are shown; the bouncer API gives no country for IP bans." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Führe auf dem CrowdSec-Host cscli bouncers add PatchNode aus und füge den Schlüssel ein. Verwende die URL der Local API hinter deinem HTTPS-Reverse-Proxy. Nur lokale Erkennungen und manuelle Sperren werden angezeigt; die Bouncer-API liefert kein Land für IP-Sperren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the CrowdSec host, run cscli bouncers add PatchNode and paste the key. Use the Local API URL behind your HTTPS reverse proxy. Only local detections and manual bans are shown; the bouncer API gives no country for IP bans."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En el host de CrowdSec, ejecuta cscli bouncers add PatchNode y pega la clave. Usa la URL de la Local API detrás de tu proxy inverso HTTPS. Solo se muestran las detecciones locales y los bloqueos manuales; la API de bouncer no da el país de las IP bloqueadas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sur l’hôte CrowdSec, lance cscli bouncers add PatchNode et colle la clé. Utilise l’URL de la Local API derrière ton reverse proxy HTTPS. Seuls les détections locales et les bannissements manuels sont affichés ; l’API bouncer ne donne pas le pays des IP bannies."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sull’host CrowdSec, esegui cscli bouncers add PatchNode e incolla la chiave. Usa l’URL della Local API dietro il tuo reverse proxy HTTPS. Sono mostrati solo i rilevamenti locali e i ban manuali; l’API dei bouncer non fornisce il paese degli IP bannati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the other iPhone, take a photo or a screenshot of this code, then Settings › Export and import › Import a QR code. No token is included." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mach auf dem anderen iPhone ein Foto oder Bildschirmfoto dieses Codes, dann Einstellungen › Exportieren und importieren › QR-Code importieren. Kein Token ist enthalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the other iPhone, take a photo or a screenshot of this code, then Settings › Export and import › Import a QR code. No token is included."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En el otro iPhone, haz una foto o una captura de este código y luego Ajustes › Exportar e importar › Importar un código QR. No incluye ningún token."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sur l’autre iPhone, prenez une photo ou une capture de ce code, puis Réglages › Exporter et importer › Importer un QR code. Aucun jeton n’est inclus."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sull’altro iPhone, scatta una foto o uno screenshot di questo codice, poi Impostazioni › Esporta e importa › Importa un codice QR. Nessun token è incluso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the server: ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Auf dem Server: ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the server: ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En el servidor: ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
