    "Prometheus has no token: keep it reachable only through your private network. If a reverse proxy adds Basic authentication (e.g. an Nginx Proxy Manager Access List), enter its user name and password, otherwise leave both fields empty." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Prometheus hat kein Token: Halte ihn nur über dein privates Netzwerk erreichbar. Fügt ein Reverse Proxy Basic-Authentifizierung hinzu (z. B. eine Access List von Nginx Proxy Manager), gib Benutzername und Passwort ein, sonst lass beide Felder leer."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prometheus has no token: keep it reachable only through your private network. If a reverse proxy adds Basic authentication (e.g. an Nginx Proxy Manager Access List), enter its user name and password, otherwise leave both fields empty."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Prometheus no tiene token: mantenlo accesible solo a través de tu red privada. Si un proxy inverso añade autenticación Basic (p. ej. una Access List de Nginx Proxy Manager), introduce su usuario y contraseña; si no, deja ambos campos vacíos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prometheus n’a pas de jeton : gardez-le joignable uniquement via votre réseau privé. Si un reverse proxy ajoute une authentification Basic (ex. une Access List de Nginx Proxy Manager), saisissez son utilisateur et son mot de passe, sinon laissez les deux champs vides."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Prometheus non ha token: rendilo raggiungibile solo dalla tua rete privata. Se un reverse proxy aggiunge l’autenticazione Basic (es. una Access List di Nginx Proxy Manager), inserisci nome utente e password, altrimenti lascia vuoti entrambi i campi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
