    "Put a read-only socket proxy (e.g. tecnativa/docker-socket-proxy with CONTAINERS=1, INFO=1, POST=0) behind an HTTPS reverse proxy with Basic authentication. With Nginx Proxy Manager: Access Lists > Add Access List, Authorization tab, add a user name and password; select that Access List on the proxy host, then enter the same user name and password below. Never expose /var/run/docker.sock or the raw port 2375: that gives full root access to the host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Setze einen schreibgeschützten Socket-Proxy (z. B. tecnativa/docker-socket-proxy mit CONTAINERS=1, INFO=1, POST=0) hinter einen HTTPS-Reverse-Proxy mit Basic-Authentifizierung. Mit Nginx Proxy Manager: Access Lists > Add Access List, Tab Authorization, Benutzername und Passwort hinzufügen; diese Access List beim Proxy-Host wählen und unten denselben Benutzernamen und dasselbe Passwort eingeben. Gib niemals /var/run/docker.sock oder den rohen Port 2375 frei: Das gewährt vollen Root-Zugriff auf den Host."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put a read-only socket proxy (e.g. tecnativa/docker-socket-proxy with CONTAINERS=1, INFO=1, POST=0) behind an HTTPS reverse proxy with Basic authentication. With Nginx Proxy Manager: Access Lists > Add Access List, Authorization tab, add a user name and password; select that Access List on the proxy host, then enter the same user name and password below. Never expose /var/run/docker.sock or the raw port 2375: that gives full root access to the host."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Pon un socket proxy de solo lectura (p. ej. tecnativa/docker-socket-proxy con CONTAINERS=1, INFO=1, POST=0) detrás de un proxy inverso HTTPS con autenticación Basic. Con Nginx Proxy Manager: Access Lists > Add Access List, pestaña Authorization, añade un usuario y una contraseña; elige esa Access List en el proxy host e introduce abajo el mismo usuario y contraseña. Nunca expongas /var/run/docker.sock ni el puerto 2375 sin protección: da acceso root completo al host."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Placez un socket proxy en lecture seule (ex. tecnativa/docker-socket-proxy avec CONTAINERS=1, INFO=1, POST=0) derrière un reverse proxy HTTPS avec authentification Basic. Avec Nginx Proxy Manager : Access Lists > Add Access List, onglet Authorization, ajoutez un utilisateur et un mot de passe ; choisissez cette Access List sur le proxy host, puis saisissez ci-dessous le même utilisateur et le même mot de passe. N’exposez jamais /var/run/docker.sock ni le port 2375 brut : cela donne un accès root complet à l’hôte."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Metti un socket proxy in sola lettura (es. tecnativa/docker-socket-proxy con CONTAINERS=1, INFO=1, POST=0) dietro un reverse proxy HTTPS con autenticazione Basic. Con Nginx Proxy Manager: Access Lists > Add Access List, scheda Authorization, aggiungi nome utente e password; seleziona quella Access List sul proxy host, poi inserisci qui sotto gli stessi nome utente e password. Non esporre mai /var/run/docker.sock né la porta 2375 non protetta: dà pieno accesso root all’host."
          }
        }
      }
    },
