    "The current key is deleted from this device: every server must receive the new public key. Remove the old line from their authorized_keys." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der aktuelle Schlüssel wird von diesem Gerät gelöscht: Jeder Server muss den neuen öffentlichen Schlüssel erhalten. Entferne die alte Zeile aus ihren authorized_keys."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The current key is deleted from this device: every server must receive the new public key. Remove the old line from their authorized_keys."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La clave actual se borra de este dispositivo: cada servidor debe recibir la nueva clave pública. Quita la línea antigua de su authorized_keys."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clé actuelle est supprimée de cet appareil : chaque serveur doit recevoir la nouvelle clé publique. Retirez l’ancienne ligne de leur authorized_keys."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La chiave attuale viene eliminata da questo dispositivo: ogni server deve ricevere la nuova chiave pubblica. Rimuovi la vecchia riga dal loro authorized_keys."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The demo uses sample data generated on this iPhone and doesn't touch your configuration." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die Demo nutzt Beispieldaten, die auf diesem iPhone erzeugt werden, und lässt deine Konfiguration unberührt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The demo uses sample data generated on this iPhone and doesn't touch your configuration."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La demo usa datos de ejemplo generados en este iPhone y no toca tu configuración."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La démo utilise des données fictives générées sur cet iPhone et ne touche pas à votre configuration."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La demo usa dati di esempio generati su questo iPhone e non tocca la tua configurazione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disks are read only with the button: disk list with SMART, then ZFS pools. Reading SMART may wake disks in standby. Disk notifications come from the last read." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die Festplatten werden nur über die Schaltfläche gelesen: Festplattenliste mit SMART, dann ZFS-Pools. Das Lesen von SMART kann Festplatten im Ruhezustand aufwecken. Festplattenmitteilungen beruhen auf der letzten Abfrage."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The disks are read only with the button: disk list with SMART, then ZFS pools. Reading SMART may wake disks in standby. Disk notifications come from the last read."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Los discos solo se leen con el botón: lista de discos con SMART y luego pools ZFS. Leer SMART puede despertar los discos en reposo. Las notificaciones de disco vienen de la última lectura."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les disques ne sont lus qu’avec le bouton : liste des disques avec SMART, puis pools ZFS. Lire SMART peut réveiller les disques en veille. Les notifications de disque viennent de la dernière lecture."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "I dischi vengono letti solo con il pulsante: elenco dei dischi con SMART, poi pool ZFS. Leggere SMART può risvegliare i dischi in standby. Le notifiche sui dischi derivano dall’ultima lettura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file couldn't be read." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die Datei konnte nicht gelesen werden."
