        }
      }
    },
    "Your tokens and passwords will be removed from iCloud Keychain, and so from your other devices, where they'll have to be entered again. They stay on this iPhone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Deine Tokens und Passwörter werden aus dem iCloud-Schlüsselbund entfernt und damit von deinen anderen Geräten, wo du sie erneut eingeben musst. Auf diesem iPhone bleiben sie erhalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your tokens and passwords will be removed from iCloud Keychain, and so from your other devices, where they'll have to be entered again. They stay on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tus tokens y contraseñas se eliminarán del Llavero de iCloud, y por tanto de tus otros dispositivos, donde tendrás que volver a introducirlos. Se quedan en este iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vos jetons et mots de passe seront retirés du trousseau iCloud, et donc de vos autres appareils, où il faudra les saisir à nouveau. Ils restent sur cet iPhone."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "I tuoi token e le tue password saranno rimossi dal Portachiavi iCloud, e quindi dagli altri tuoi dispositivi, dove dovrai inserirli di nuovo. Restano su questo iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tokens and passwords will be stored in iCloud Keychain, end-to-end encrypted, and available on your devices signed in to the same Apple Account. Anyone who can unlock one of these devices could use them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Deine Tokens und Passwörter werden im iCloud-Schlüsselbund gespeichert, Ende-zu-Ende-verschlüsselt, und sind auf deinen Geräten mit demselben Apple Account verfügbar. Wer eines dieser Geräte entsperren kann, könnte sie verwenden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your tokens and passwords will be stored in iCloud Keychain, end-to-end encrypted, and available on your devices signed in to the same Apple Account. Anyone who can unlock one of these devices could use them."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tus tokens y contraseñas se guardarán en el Llavero de iCloud, con cifrado de extremo a extremo, y estarán disponibles en tus dispositivos con la misma cuenta de Apple. Cualquiera que pueda desbloquear uno de esos dispositivos podría usarlos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vos jetons et mots de passe seront enregistrés dans le trousseau iCloud, chiffrés de bout en bout, et disponibles sur vos appareils connectés au même compte Apple. Quiconque peut déverrouiller l’un de ces appareils pourrait les utiliser."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "I tuoi token e le tue password saranno salvati nel Portachiavi iCloud, con crittografia end-to-end, e disponibili sui tuoi dispositivi collegati allo stesso Account Apple. Chiunque possa sbloccare uno di questi dispositivi potrebbe usarli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tokens travel with every request. PatchNode accepts only HTTPS with a valid certificate: put your services behind a reverse proxy with, for example, a Let's Encrypt certificate." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Deine Tokens werden mit jeder Anfrage übertragen. PatchNode akzeptiert nur HTTPS mit gültigem Zertifikat: Stelle deine Dienste hinter einen Reverse Proxy, zum Beispiel mit einem Let’s-Encrypt-Zertifikat."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your tokens travel with every request. PatchNode accepts only HTTPS with a valid certificate: put your services behind a reverse proxy with, for example, a Let's Encrypt certificate."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tus tokens viajan con cada petición. PatchNode solo acepta HTTPS con un certificado válido: pon tus servicios detrás de un proxy inverso con, por ejemplo, un certificado Let's Encrypt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vos jetons voyagent avec chaque requête. PatchNode n’accepte que HTTPS avec un certificat valide : placez vos services derrière un reverse proxy avec, par exemple, un certificat Let’s Encrypt."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "I tuoi token viaggiano con ogni richiesta. PatchNode accetta solo HTTPS con un certificato valido: metti i tuoi servizi dietro un reverse proxy con, per esempio, un certificato Let’s Encrypt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your VPN must be on for the checks to reach your services. When every service is unreachable at once, PatchNode assumes the VPN is off and doesn't notify." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Dein VPN muss aktiv sein, damit die Prüfungen deine Dienste erreichen. Sind alle Dienste gleichzeitig nicht erreichbar, nimmt PatchNode an, dass das VPN aus ist, und meldet nichts."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your VPN must be on for the checks to reach your services. When every service is unreachable at once, PatchNode assumes the VPN is off and doesn't notify."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tu VPN debe estar activa para que las comprobaciones lleguen a tus servicios. Cuando todos los servicios son inaccesibles a la vez, PatchNode supone que la VPN está desactivada y no notifica."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre VPN doit être actif pour que les vérifications atteignent vos services. Quand tous les services sont injoignables en même temps, PatchNode suppose que le VPN est coupé et ne notifie pas."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La VPN deve essere attiva perché i controlli raggiungano i tuoi servizi. Quando tutti i servizi sono irraggiungibili insieme, PatchNode presume che la VPN sia spenta e non notifica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
